                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Given that it goes on sale for as low as $2 I'll recommend it. Overall I really enjoyed the combat system, story was ok.\nCaveats: I played it modded to remove permadeath and add more classes\n\nI enjoyed the combat system a lot and the class system was definitely interesting once it started to open up and connect. Granted the leveling system being rng was a bit of a wash for me since it sort of ends up either mattering a lot or not at all depending on how hard you are trying to min/max\n\nThe story was servicable, it was a reason to go from point A to point B. Nothing stood out for me good or bad.",
